  "problem": "Which of the graphs below represent proportional relationships?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14184158/assets/4cc220afc9f6b1f8752076d0b8d8233caec22e937c0579926439b39472be8c80.png)",
